            title: 'Crazy 4 Poker',
            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Crazy 4 Poker (Buy Your Card) is a stud poker variant where players ante, receive five cards (two down, three up), then have three rounds of buying followed by betting. Players can pay 1, 2, 3, or 4 units to replace a card from four options (three face-up cards and the top of the deck). High-low with declaration; best hand wins.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Country/Region of Origin: USA\nTime Period: Early 1900s\nHistorical Development: The game evolved from traditional card games in the region\nCultural Significance: Popular social and family game',
              },
            ],
          },
