                text: 'Standard 52-card deck, poker chips for ante and betting.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Five cards per player: two face down (hole cards), three face up. Dealer then places three cards face up in a row and the deck face down at the end. Dealing pattern: clockwise.',
              },
